  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="10.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 10.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be wore gewitnesse. Gif mon þonne afinde, þæt heora ænig on wore gewitnesse wære, þæt næfre his gewitnes eft noht ne forstonde; ⁊ eac gesylle XXX scll' to wite.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">But if it is found that any one of them has borne false witness, never again shall his witness be valid; and moreover he shall pay a fine of 30 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon ðonne onfinde, þæt heora ænig on fore gewitnysse sy, þæt his gewitnysse næfre eft nawht ne forstande; ⁊ gesylle eac XXX scill. to wite.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
